// 九尾狐 on all fours, for the skinned-mesh spike: a white fox spirit after
// the chibi kitsune Roger picked. A round, cat-like face with a short
// muzzle, big eyes with a pink iris, red eyeliner and two red stripes on
// each cheek, ears red from the tip down, flaring cheek tufts, a fluffy
// ruff, a red cord with a bell, and nine long wisps of tail in a bouquet,
// each an S of five bones, white through pink to red, swaying like flames.
// The tails come from gen_tails.py: change them there and paste the
// output back in.
